(3052291, 430092, 60165, '<td valign="top">So, you were born in ... 1776 :-) Sorry, couldn''t resist, and I might not be the only one. <br/> <br/>Nice picture, I like the gradient of the sky, but too bad part of the bell is slightly out of focus, with this light, you should have been able to have all of it in focus?</td>', 'So, you were born in ... 1776 :-) Sorry, couldn''t resist, and I might not be the only one.  Nice picture, I like the gradient of the sky, but too bad part of the bell is slightly out of focus, with this light, you should have been able to have all of it in focus?', '2006-11-22 00:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
