(3052337, 430330, 60165, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=400602" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/559/thumb/400602.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/559/thumb/400602.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/559/thumb/400602.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/><i>Take us back to yesteryear by photographing something that defined the year you were born. Start googling, looking through old news papers and magazines, and show us your photographic interpretation of the year of your birth. <b>Your title should should include the year</b>. </i> <br/> <br/>Doh! But a nice picture ...</td>', '  Take us back to yesteryear by photographing something that defined the year you were born. Start googling, looking through old news papers and magazines, and show us your photographic interpretation of the year of your birth. Your title should should include the year.   Doh! But a nice picture ...', '2006-11-22 00:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3052343, 430427, 18339, '<td valign="top">This came out great Jen!  I would say one of the best in the challenge :)  Good luck :)</td>', 'This came out great Jen!  I would say one of the best in the challenge :)  Good luck :)', '2006-11-22 00:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
