(3053833, 429494, 68256, '<td valign="top">Nice balance and use of color. I really like the border, ties it up nicely.  I don''t really like the tape on the glasses and I''m unsure on the head cropping, but it is balanced.......</td>', 'Nice balance and use of color. I really like the border, ties it up nicely.  I don''t really like the tape on the glasses and I''m unsure on the head cropping, but it is balanced.......', '2006-11-22 09:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
