(3054091, 430463, 39429, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  There is such exuberance and delight in the expression, the pose and the set up.  I love the sense of freedom shown in the "frumpy" nude body, which shows skin, but not sexuality per say.  The stuff near her head and back, plus the lighting above her head are a problem, yet I still love the shot.  9</td>', 'I love this shot.  There is such exuberance and delight in the expression, the pose and the set up.  I love the sense of freedom shown in the "frumpy" nude body, which shows skin, but not sexuality per say.  The stuff near her head and back, plus the lighting above her head are a problem, yet I still love the shot.  9', '2006-11-22 10:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
