(3054114, 430453, 39429, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  The exchange between the girls is great.  Your details keep this from being even higher.  The clothes and hair ties bring this to recent times and the colors seem to bright for the photos of that era as prints tended to fade over time.  Even the gaze (which I love) brings it forward in time.  As the ruling went into place, the understanding wasn''t there very much and the eyes were lacking contact at that time.  Even so, 8</td>', 'Very well done.  The exchange between the girls is great.  Your details keep this from being even higher.  The clothes and hair ties bring this to recent times and the colors seem to bright for the photos of that era as prints tended to fade over time.  Even the gaze (which I love) brings it forward in time.  As the ruling went into place, the understanding wasn''t there very much and the eyes were lacking contact at that time.  Even so, 8', '2006-11-22 10:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054125, 430473, 39429, '<td valign="top">Top notch photo!  The perspective is terrific, as is the processing.  Very much the feel of the 60''s with the noise and tones.  Some small detail are pulling this forward in time, the wide tie, the hair cut and even the fit of the shirt.  That is soooo hard to avoid.  Excellent work 9</td>', 'Top notch photo!  The perspective is terrific, as is the processing.  Very much the feel of the 60''s with the noise and tones.  Some small detail are pulling this forward in time, the wide tie, the hair cut and even the fit of the shirt.  That is soooo hard to avoid.  Excellent work 9', '2006-11-22 10:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054129, 429615, 66727, '<td valign="top">I''m impressed</td>', 'I''m impressed', '2006-11-22 11:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054136, 430287, 39429, '<td valign="top">The pose, coloration and crop all work together to make this image really work.  You''ve identified the population that was impacted very heavily in the outbreak, without identifing a person. Simple, yet very powerful.  8</td>', 'The pose, coloration and crop all work together to make this image really work.  You''ve identified the population that was impacted very heavily in the outbreak, without identifing a person. Simple, yet very powerful.  8', '2006-11-22 11:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054141, 428752, 39429, '<td valign="top">Great 60''s feel in this shot.  Love the cars and the very 60''s motel.  Even the tones in the shot come across as 60''s.  I am confused as to what actually happened on that date.  I can bring it down to a few possibilities, but sometimes I just want the quick answer.  7</td>', 'Great 60''s feel in this shot.  Love the cars and the very 60''s motel.  Even the tones in the shot come across as 60''s.  I am confused as to what actually happened on that date.  I can bring it down to a few possibilities, but sometimes I just want the quick answer.  7', '2006-11-22 11:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054148, 430369, 39429, '<td valign="top">Very strong shot.  Your model gives off a Bobby Fischer look, and so does the image.  The tie pulls the image forward in time, and so does the dark background - small nitpicks.  Wonderful shot. 7</td>', 'Very strong shot.  Your model gives off a Bobby Fischer look, and so does the image.  The tie pulls the image forward in time, and so does the dark background - small nitpicks.  Wonderful shot. 7', '2006-11-22 11:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
