(3054155, 430011, 39429, '<td valign="top">Very interesting take on the subject.  This comes across as more graphic than photographic, yet still brings a sense of the drama and significance of the milestone.  7</td>', 'Very interesting take on the subject.  This comes across as more graphic than photographic, yet still brings a sense of the drama and significance of the milestone.  7', '2006-11-22 11:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054161, 428607, 39429, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  The processing both adds and takes away from the shot.  I love it on the jar, hands and sleeves.  In the hair, table and background, I get lost and have a hard time understanding where I am.  It send a stong feel of out of reality and fading away into nothingness. 7</td>', 'Very interesting.  The processing both adds and takes away from the shot.  I love it on the jar, hands and sleeves.  In the hair, table and background, I get lost and have a hard time understanding where I am.  It send a stong feel of out of reality and fading away into nothingness. 7', '2006-11-22 11:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054162, 429615, 39429, '<td valign="top">Very strong mood with this shot.  You''ve really captured the drama of impending war.</td>', 'Very strong mood with this shot.  You''ve really captured the drama of impending war.', '2006-11-22 11:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054172, 429102, 39429, '<td valign="top">I believe this is Judi.  Great lighting and sense of the times.  There''s a beauty and magic to this image that really stands out. The crop feels just a tad too far left.  7</td>', 'I believe this is Judi.  Great lighting and sense of the times.  There''s a beauty and magic to this image that really stands out. The crop feels just a tad too far left.  7', '2006-11-22 11:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054173, 430379, 66727, '<td valign="top">Cool idea</td>', 'Cool idea', '2006-11-22 11:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054176, 430292, 39429, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good energy and wonderful props.  The short shirt brings this shot forward in time.  The skin stones are a bit strang, too.  Still a wonderful shot which should do well. 7</td>', 'Nice shot, good energy and wonderful props.  The short shirt brings this shot forward in time.  The skin stones are a bit strang, too.  Still a wonderful shot which should do well. 7', '2006-11-22 11:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054181, 430117, 39429, '<td valign="top">Strong concept and image.  Title matches well.  7</td>', 'Strong concept and image.  Title matches well.  7', '2006-11-22 11:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054186, 430381, 39429, '<td valign="top">Good DOF.  Overall, the image is average, but the small size bring the impact down.  Go to the Learn section and view the tutorial of preparing an image for the challenge.  You should do well in the future. 4</td>', 'Good DOF.  Overall, the image is average, but the small size bring the impact down.  Go to the Learn section and view the tutorial of preparing an image for the challenge.  You should do well in the future. 4', '2006-11-22 11:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054200, 429100, 39429, '<td valign="top">This image loses impact for me.  Your centered movie is a bit OOF, and the set up doesn''t seem to enhance the movie image.  This looks like an attempt that started well, but didn''t convey what you were intending. 4</td>', 'This image loses impact for me.  Your centered movie is a bit OOF, and the set up doesn''t seem to enhance the movie image.  This looks like an attempt that started well, but didn''t convey what you were intending. 4', '2006-11-22 11:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054201, 430085, 39429, '<td valign="top">If the tomato is your center of interest, it would work better in focus.  I do like the selective desat. 4</td>', 'If the tomato is your center of interest, it would work better in focus.  I do like the selective desat. 4', '2006-11-22 11:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054210, 429178, 39429, '<td valign="top">The image is decent and fairly interesting.  However, I''m lost on what kind of meaning this has for the viewer.  It''s as though I have a piece of the story, but not the knowledge to understand it. 4</td>', 'The image is decent and fairly interesting.  However, I''m lost on what kind of meaning this has for the viewer.  It''s as though I have a piece of the story, but not the knowledge to understand it. 4', '2006-11-22 11:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054217, 430482, 39429, '<td valign="top">Decent take on photographing a date in stone, but I lose the meaning that this date has.  I need more context to apply a feel, a mood or a story to the numbers.  Gravestone?  Monument?  Building marker?  4</td>', 'Decent take on photographing a date in stone, but I lose the meaning that this date has.  I need more context to apply a feel, a mood or a story to the numbers.  Gravestone?  Monument?  Building marker?  4', '2006-11-22 11:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054221, 429801, 39429, '<td valign="top">Yes, you''ve photographed some paper symbols of the year.  Some I understand and some I don''t.  It doesn''t use the power of photography to truely show the time and emotion.  Keep working on it. 3</td>', 'Yes, you''ve photographed some paper symbols of the year.  Some I understand and some I don''t.  It doesn''t use the power of photography to truely show the time and emotion.  Keep working on it. 3', '2006-11-22 11:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054224, 429986, 14620, '<td valign="top">Too Funny!!  Definitely brings back some memories. :)  I like the tilt.</td>', 'Too Funny!!  Definitely brings back some memories. :)  I like the tilt.', '2006-11-22 11:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054228, 430408, 39429, '<td valign="top">Nice photo of a penny.  The overall image doesn''t say much to the view, except "here''s what a 58 penny looks like".  The fingers don''t add to the shot, and the nail chip detracts.  4</td>', 'Nice photo of a penny.  The overall image doesn''t say much to the view, except "here''s what a 58 penny looks like".  The fingers don''t add to the shot, and the nail chip detracts.  4', '2006-11-22 11:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054240, 430478, 39429, '<td valign="top">Interesting background.  Fun subject.  The image itself doesn''t quite carry off the baby birth of the smiley face.  It comes across as "Why do I have someone in a baby hat and swim suit with a smiley face?"  Keep trying. 4</td>', 'Interesting background.  Fun subject.  The image itself doesn''t quite carry off the baby birth of the smiley face.  It comes across as "Why do I have someone in a baby hat and swim suit with a smiley face?"  Keep trying. 4', '2006-11-22 11:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054247, 428810, 39429, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the inaugural NY Marathon, but this image doesn''t really portray that feel, IMO.  4</td>', 'I like the idea of the inaugural NY Marathon, but this image doesn''t really portray that feel, IMO.  4', '2006-11-22 11:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054254, 430292, 5885, '<td valign="top">I remember those :-)</td>', 'I remember those :-)', '2006-11-22 11:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054256, 430253, 39429, '<td valign="top">An interesting time in history.  The title detracts.  The pencil seems out of place and the letter alone is only an image of an artifact.  I''d love to see more context in this image. 4</td>', 'An interesting time in history.  The title detracts.  The pencil seems out of place and the letter alone is only an image of an artifact.  I''d love to see more context in this image. 4', '2006-11-22 11:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054257, 430251, 39429, '<td valign="top">"Your title should include the year."  I''m guessing in the 60''s from the style of BW, but there''s not enough to really pin down the time period.</td>', '"Your title should include the year."  I''m guessing in the 60''s from the style of BW, but there''s not enough to really pin down the time period.', '2006-11-22 11:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054259, 430011, 5885, '<td valign="top">This would be an awesome stock shot</td>', 'This would be an awesome stock shot', '2006-11-22 11:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054265, 429969, 39429, '<td valign="top">I''m a bit lost on the meaning of the photo.  As an ambassador, was Samantha kept in a closet?  The image is technically decent.  It gives the feel of the time and the selective desat/sepia works well.  It''s what the image is trying to portray that loses me. 4</td>', 'I''m a bit lost on the meaning of the photo.  As an ambassador, was Samantha kept in a closet?  The image is technically decent.  It gives the feel of the time and the selective desat/sepia works well.  It''s what the image is trying to portray that loses me. 4', '2006-11-22 11:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054266, 429309, 45003, '<td valign="top">I''m usually not a big fan of this kind of postprocessing, but when I think of pictures the 60s/70s and Jimi Hendrix I feel that it fits well.</td>', 'I''m usually not a big fan of this kind of postprocessing, but when I think of pictures the 60s/70s and Jimi Hendrix I feel that it fits well.', '2006-11-22 11:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
