(3054276, 430143, 51538, '<td valign="top">A florin there, I see.  The mint has never issued anything as nice as the threepenny bit since. 7.</td>', 'A florin there, I see.  The mint has never issued anything as nice as the threepenny bit since. 7.', '2006-11-22 11:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054279, 429293, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice clean photo. 7.</td>', 'Nice clean photo. 7.', '2006-11-22 11:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054280, 430386, 39429, '<td valign="top">Decent portrait beginning.  The pose works for the Godfather and you have some decent detail in the suit and chair with the lighting set up.  The problem comes in the backdrop (only partially covering and very wrinkled) and the strong backlight to the right of the chair (bright light pulls the eye toward it, in this case away from the subject.)  Keep trying, you''ve got a good beginning. 4</td>', 'Decent portrait beginning.  The pose works for the Godfather and you have some decent detail in the suit and chair with the lighting set up.  The problem comes in the backdrop (only partially covering and very wrinkled) and the strong backlight to the right of the chair (bright light pulls the eye toward it, in this case away from the subject.)  Keep trying, you''ve got a good beginning. 4', '2006-11-22 11:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054282, 430274, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Just wish for a bit better lighting. 6.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Just wish for a bit better lighting. 6.', '2006-11-22 11:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054284, 430143, 40397, '<td valign="top">environmental damage?</td>', 'environmental damage?', '2006-11-22 11:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054285, 429102, 45003, '<td valign="top">What year was this? Very dreamy mood and nice warm colors. Would have loved to see the eye a bit more in focus though.</td>', 'What year was this? Very dreamy mood and nice warm colors. Would have loved to see the eye a bit more in focus though.', '2006-11-22 11:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054286, 429543, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed. 8.</td>', 'Nicely composed. 8.', '2006-11-22 11:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054291, 430446, 39429, '<td valign="top">The smoke shows up well - but the innocence of the stuffed bear and the smoking joint don''t quite fit for me with this title.  4</td>', 'The smoke shows up well - but the innocence of the stuffed bear and the smoking joint don''t quite fit for me with this title.  4', '2006-11-22 11:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054292, 430046, 39429, '<td valign="top">"You should include the year in your title."  I''m not sure what year/decade this is to represent.  I''d like to.  ;-) 4</td>', '"You should include the year in your title."  I''m not sure what year/decade this is to represent.  I''d like to.  ;-) 4', '2006-11-22 11:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054293, 427682, 39429, '<td valign="top">"You should include the year in your title."  I don''t know my bike history well enough to know the year or even the decade.  The spokes are interesting visually. 4</td>', '"You should include the year in your title."  I don''t know my bike history well enough to know the year or even the decade.  The spokes are interesting visually. 4', '2006-11-22 11:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
