(3054323, 429904, 51538, '<td valign="top">No a/c in those cars. 7 years later, my mother and father and I in a similar wagon left Tasmania, drove from Adelaide through Bendigo..... Kalgoorlie across the Nullabor to Perth and then around again.  one the road for the first 2 years of my life.  I certainly ate my pound of dust and swallowed a few flies too. 7.</td>', 'No a/c in those cars. 7 years later, my mother and father and I in a similar wagon left Tasmania, drove from Adelaide through Bendigo..... Kalgoorlie across the Nullabor to Perth and then around again.  one the road for the first 2 years of my life.  I certainly ate my pound of dust and swallowed a few flies too. 7.', '2006-11-22 11:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054325, 430300, 66543, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, just a shame that some parts of the photo is out of focus which definitely is distracting</td>', 'Nice photo, just a shame that some parts of the photo is out of focus which definitely is distracting', '2006-11-22 11:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054326, 430302, 32644, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Wrong car...</td>', 'Great shot! Wrong car...', '2006-11-22 11:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054327, 428181, 57202, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites of the entire challenge! :D  Not only does it completely meet the challenge, but it is technically excellent.  Though it''s a tad dark, I think it might actually help with the grungy look of the shot.  Not only do I love that the hands are dirty and greasy, but the fact that you put him in corduroys is perfect!!!</td>', 'This is one of my favorites of the entire challenge! :D  Not only does it completely meet the challenge, but it is technically excellent.  Though it''s a tad dark, I think it might actually help with the grungy look of the shot.  Not only do I love that the hands are dirty and greasy, but the fact that you put him in corduroys is perfect!!!', '2006-11-22 11:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3054331, 429533, 51538, '<td valign="top">Bravo... a nice image too.</td>', 'Bravo... a nice image too.', '2006-11-22 11:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
