(3054340, 429615, 57202, '<td valign="top">While the foreground is a little dark, I think it helps add to the ominous mood of this shot.  The composition is awesome and the clouds shape the entire tone of the photo.  Well done! :)</td>', 'While the foreground is a little dark, I think it helps add to the ominous mood of this shot.  The composition is awesome and the clouds shape the entire tone of the photo.  Well done! :)', '2006-11-22 11:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
