(3056672, 429986, 56109, '<td valign="top">Before reading the title, I noticed the classic dust-blow going on in the corner. I was also born in this year, so I can relate. I would have like to see some mario or paperboy, but nonetheless...great shot. A+</td>', 'Before reading the title, I noticed the classic dust-blow going on in the corner. I was also born in this year, so I can relate. I would have like to see some mario or paperboy, but nonetheless...great shot. A+', '2006-11-23 01:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
