(3056685, 430020, 56109, '<td valign="top">saved my mothers life. powerful and wonderful shot. thanks.</td>', 'saved my mothers life. powerful and wonderful shot. thanks.', '2006-11-23 01:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3056714, 428198, 39429, '<td valign="top">"Your title should should include the year."  Sorry, I''m a bit lost on the year - I haven''t memorized the Chinese calendar.  <br/> <br/>I like the origami pig and the way it ties into the calendar.  I find I have more questions than answers with this image.  The BG leaves me wondering if I''m missing something or not.  Overall, it comes off as a quick snapshot, yet the work on the pig makes me think I''m missing something. 4</td>', '"Your title should should include the year."  Sorry, I''m a bit lost on the year - I haven''t memorized the Chinese calendar.   I like the origami pig and the way it ties into the calendar.  I find I have more questions than answers with this image.  The BG leaves me wondering if I''m missing something or not.  Overall, it comes off as a quick snapshot, yet the work on the pig makes me think I''m missing something. 4', '2006-11-23 02:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3056717, 430458, 39429, '<td valign="top">The quality of the image is decent.  Good tones on the hand, with good lighting.  However, for me, this image is telling me what 1979 is NOT, not what 1979 IS.  4</td>', 'The quality of the image is decent.  Good tones on the hand, with good lighting.  However, for me, this image is telling me what 1979 is NOT, not what 1979 IS.  4', '2006-11-23 02:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3056725, 430413, 39429, '<td valign="top">Interesting collection of stuff there.  Since I live near the original KFC restaurant, I thought your date was off.  Sure enough, KFC was founded in 1952 (no bid deal, but interesting.)  <br/> <br/>Decent shot, but the result ends up lacking visual interest.  4</td>', 'Interesting collection of stuff there.  Since I live near the original KFC restaurant, I thought your date was off.  Sure enough, KFC was founded in 1952 (no bid deal, but interesting.)   Decent shot, but the result ends up lacking visual interest.  4', '2006-11-23 02:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3056731, 430477, 39429, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure of the connection with the clothing and the year.  I know that similar clothers were made long before 1975.  If I''m missing a connection, please let me know.<br/> <br/>Visually, the coloring combines well, and there are some interesting textures.  Nothing about the image really grabs my attention. 4</td>', 'I''m not sure of the connection with the clothing and the year.  I know that similar clothers were made long before 1975.  If I''m missing a connection, please let me know. Visually, the coloring combines well, and there are some interesting textures.  Nothing about the image really grabs my attention. 4', '2006-11-23 02:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3056734, 430143, 39429, '<td valign="top">A decent shot of 1951 coins.  Not being a coin collector, I''m wishing for more of a story of connection with the uniqueness of 1951.<br/> <br/>Technically, I''m missing detail on the copper coins and seeing hot spots on the silver coin.  4</td>', 'A decent shot of 1951 coins.  Not being a coin collector, I''m wishing for more of a story of connection with the uniqueness of 1951. Technically, I''m missing detail on the copper coins and seeing hot spots on the silver coin.  4', '2006-11-23 02:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3056744, 430302, 48967, '<td valign="top">hahahaha pretty clever! XD</td>', 'hahahaha pretty clever! XD', '2006-11-23 02:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3056745, 430379, 48967, '<td valign="top">stunning!</td>', 'stunning!', '2006-11-23 02:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3056747, 430085, 48967, '<td valign="top">uh I didn''t know that!</td>', 'uh I didn''t know that!', '2006-11-23 02:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3056752, 430482, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, although your photo fits the challenge, it doesn''t hold my interest. It needs another element or two to hold my attention longer.</td>', 'For me, although your photo fits the challenge, it doesn''t hold my interest. It needs another element or two to hold my attention longer.', '2006-11-23 02:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3056754, 430085, 41675, '<td valign="top">It could be a tomato, yet it appears to look more like a red gumball - to my untrained and non-vegetarian eyes. I also keep looking down at the water droplets. They draw my attention away from your main subject.</td>', 'It could be a tomato, yet it appears to look more like a red gumball - to my untrained and non-vegetarian eyes. I also keep looking down at the water droplets. They draw my attention away from your main subject.', '2006-11-23 02:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3056759, 430470, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, if your photo was a bit more focused - either on the peace sign or the face I would have scored it higher. Good idea to represent the ear though.</td>', 'For me, if your photo was a bit more focused - either on the peace sign or the face I would have scored it higher. Good idea to represent the ear though.', '2006-11-23 02:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3056763, 429801, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice idea to combine different elements. Iwonder how this would look if they weren''t lined up or if there were three instead of an even number of four?</td>', 'Nice idea to combine different elements. Iwonder how this would look if they weren''t lined up or if there were three instead of an even number of four?', '2006-11-23 02:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3056865, 430463, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is astonishing! Quite in the spirit of Monty Python, no kidding... I wish that *thing* weren''t sticking out of her head...</td>', 'This is astonishing! Quite in the spirit of Monty Python, no kidding... I wish that *thing* weren''t sticking out of her head...', '2006-11-23 03:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
