(3058458, 430092, 39429, '<td valign="top">A nice idea for the challenge.  The composition and POV work with you on this shot, but the harsh lightening has cause some problems resulting in an average shot.  5</td>', 'A nice idea for the challenge.  The composition and POV work with you on this shot, but the harsh lightening has cause some problems resulting in an average shot.  5', '2006-11-23 22:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058461, 430117, 67361, '<td valign="top">very good thinking</td>', 'very good thinking', '2006-11-23 23:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058465, 430302, 39429, '<td valign="top">I remember the show.  I can see what you were going for, but it didn''t quite work.  The car looks like a toy.  The flames, while interesting, are overexposed and the lack of focus in the forground caused you problems.  Even with these flaws, the image comes to the average range for me.  5</td>', 'I remember the show.  I can see what you were going for, but it didn''t quite work.  The car looks like a toy.  The flames, while interesting, are overexposed and the lack of focus in the forground caused you problems.  Even with these flaws, the image comes to the average range for me.  5', '2006-11-23 23:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058474, 430252, 39429, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful original radio.  The concept is wonderful, yet did not live up to its potential.  A different background and more interesting lighting would have lifted this image up several levels. 5</td>', 'This is a wonderful original radio.  The concept is wonderful, yet did not live up to its potential.  A different background and more interesting lighting would have lifted this image up several levels. 5', '2006-11-23 23:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058489, 429681, 39429, '<td valign="top">A very well composed and graphically strong image.  However, overall it came out average to me.  The foreground details are nearly lost in the lighting, the image is disturbing, and the event has no impact to me personally. I don''t know who Sid Vicious is or what impact she had on the year.  5</td>', 'A very well composed and graphically strong image.  However, overall it came out average to me.  The foreground details are nearly lost in the lighting, the image is disturbing, and the event has no impact to me personally. I don''t know who Sid Vicious is or what impact she had on the year.  5', '2006-11-23 23:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058494, 429986, 41337, '<td valign="top">Excitebike ruled!</td>', 'Excitebike ruled!', '2006-11-23 23:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058499, 429972, 39429, '<td valign="top">I suppose I am naive, but I didn''t know what the red loop ribbon stood for until I saw it in context on another image.  The image itself is nice with a strong graphic quality to it.  The composition is good and the processing works.  I''m bothered by the wrinkles and inperfections in the cloth, yet believe that may be part of the message.  The lack of context left it average for me. 5</td>', 'I suppose I am naive, but I didn''t know what the red loop ribbon stood for until I saw it in context on another image.  The image itself is nice with a strong graphic quality to it.  The composition is good and the processing works.  I''m bothered by the wrinkles and inperfections in the cloth, yet believe that may be part of the message.  The lack of context left it average for me. 5', '2006-11-23 23:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058505, 430403, 39429, '<td valign="top">I''m out of the loop, but haven''t seen the movie.  Still, I get the gist of a machine, Hal, being involved.  This image comes across as more of a computer generated graphic than a photo.  Between that and not knowing the reference well enough to pick up on the detail, it left the image average for me. 5</td>', 'I''m out of the loop, but haven''t seen the movie.  Still, I get the gist of a machine, Hal, being involved.  This image comes across as more of a computer generated graphic than a photo.  Between that and not knowing the reference well enough to pick up on the detail, it left the image average for me. 5', '2006-11-23 23:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058509, 430442, 39429, '<td valign="top">This photo came across as average for me.  I can see some detail on the coins, but it is lost in other places and does not come across as done purposefully for artistic reasons.  The lighting did not help with the strong reflections.  Some kind of diffuser would help with that. 5</td>', 'This photo came across as average for me.  I can see some detail on the coins, but it is lost in other places and does not come across as done purposefully for artistic reasons.  The lighting did not help with the strong reflections.  Some kind of diffuser would help with that. 5', '2006-11-23 23:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058512, 429533, 39429, '<td valign="top">An interesting display of Apartheid memorabilia.  The song lyrics add to the feeling of sadness and loss.  I sense a stong division between youth and innocence lost, and death and distruction with details that are there, yet not discernable.<br/> <br/>I''d love to see this sharper so I can see the details.  At the same time, this collection comes across as a display or mural, not a photo. 5</td>', 'An interesting display of Apartheid memorabilia.  The song lyrics add to the feeling of sadness and loss.  I sense a stong division between youth and innocence lost, and death and distruction with details that are there, yet not discernable. I''d love to see this sharper so I can see the details.  At the same time, this collection comes across as a display or mural, not a photo. 5', '2006-11-23 23:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058514, 430284, 41337, '<td valign="top">Bumping up. Just finished voting and this one is the best, IMO. Just something about it is captivating.</td>', 'Bumping up. Just finished voting and this one is the best, IMO. Just something about it is captivating.', '2006-11-23 23:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058515, 430358, 39429, '<td valign="top">Technically good, yet I have little to no emotional connection, which leaves this as an average shot to me.  5</td>', 'Technically good, yet I have little to no emotional connection, which leaves this as an average shot to me.  5', '2006-11-23 23:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058520, 430473, 41337, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments. I like this shot and scored it well. My only quibble is the noise is a bit too much. Having that much makes it look a bit too fake, IMO.</td>', 'Returning for comments. I like this shot and scored it well. My only quibble is the noise is a bit too much. Having that much makes it look a bit too fake, IMO.', '2006-11-23 23:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058522, 430039, 39429, '<td valign="top">I''m torn on this shot.  On one hand, I love the colors and shapes.  On the other hand, what looks like wonderful lighting has been subdued to the point that the image looks rather flat and lacking in contrast. 5</td>', 'I''m torn on this shot.  On one hand, I love the colors and shapes.  On the other hand, what looks like wonderful lighting has been subdued to the point that the image looks rather flat and lacking in contrast. 5', '2006-11-23 23:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058523, 429688, 41337, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments. This is really slick looking. The tonal range is perfect. Good luck!</td>', 'Returning for comments. This is really slick looking. The tonal range is perfect. Good luck!', '2006-11-23 23:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058531, 430117, 41337, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments. This is a cool shot. The lighting is both a postive and a negative here. I love the backlighting but the highlights in some places is a bit too extreme. Wouldn''t matter normally but since this is a setup shot with controlled lighting it''s a deduction. However, it still gets a 7 from me. I''d say good luck but I predict you will ribbon here.</td>', 'Returning for comments. This is a cool shot. The lighting is both a postive and a negative here. I love the backlighting but the highlights in some places is a bit too extreme. Wouldn''t matter normally but since this is a setup shot with controlled lighting it''s a deduction. However, it still gets a 7 from me. I''d say good luck but I predict you will ribbon here.', '2006-11-23 23:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058535, 430427, 41337, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments. <br/> <br/>Ah my year of birth. Good shot. I hope the american flag haters don''t penalize this too much.</td>', 'Returning for comments.  Ah my year of birth. Good shot. I hope the american flag haters don''t penalize this too much.', '2006-11-23 23:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058538, 429102, 41337, '<td valign="top">Excellent take to the challenge.</td>', 'Excellent take to the challenge.', '2006-11-23 23:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058711, 428514, 68565, '<td valign="top">strong colors<br/>face over retouched</td>', 'strong colorsface over retouched', '2006-11-24 01:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058714, 430292, 29659, '<td valign="top">Her skin tones look a bit sickly to me.</td>', 'Her skin tones look a bit sickly to me.', '2006-11-24 01:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058717, 429543, 29659, '<td valign="top">I thought it was going to be the year that telegraph was invented.  I was seriously impressed.  ;)</td>', 'I thought it was going to be the year that telegraph was invented.  I was seriously impressed.  ;)', '2006-11-24 01:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058769, 430463, 45475, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is too precious! You''re a star!! Will the yanks get this??</td>', 'Oh, this is too precious! You''re a star!! Will the yanks get this??', '2006-11-24 01:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058844, 430446, 50034, '<td valign="top">Beary good news!  :)</td>', 'Beary good news!  :)', '2006-11-24 03:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058851, 430474, 50034, '<td valign="top">"Jingle, Jingle, Jingle...I can hear those sleigh bells ring!  I am old Kris Kringle!...I''m the King of Jing-gle-ling!"  I was only four, but I think I remember that day!  <i>I''m so glad bumbles bounce because I was so afraid for Klondike Kornelius!</i></td>', '"Jingle, Jingle, Jingle...I can hear those sleigh bells ring!  I am old Kris Kringle!...I''m the King of Jing-gle-ling!"  I was only four, but I think I remember that day!  I''m so glad bumbles bounce because I was so afraid for Klondike Kornelius!', '2006-11-24 03:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058857, 430046, 56400, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I''m not quite sure what year this depicts. Are you claiming to be as old as this grinning fat man?</td>', 'Hmmm, I''m not quite sure what year this depicts. Are you claiming to be as old as this grinning fat man?', '2006-11-24 03:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058861, 429431, 50034, '<td valign="top"><b>Truly bittersweet that year!</b>  However, I learned much about other countries...like <b>Vasilli Alexiev</b>, the Russian world record holding weight lifter whose tanktop looked like a thong on the upper torso (He could have been a sumo wrestler, too, if he had wanted to be...I am quite sure) and <b>Nadia Comaneche</b>, sweet little gymnast, who was probably my first famous person crush...I know...in unison...Awwwwwwww!  :}</td>', 'Truly bittersweet that year!  However, I learned much about other countries...like Vasilli Alexiev, the Russian world record holding weight lifter whose tanktop looked like a thong on the upper torso (He could have been a sumo wrestler, too, if he had wanted to be...I am quite sure) and Nadia Comaneche, sweet little gymnast, who was probably my first famous person crush...I know...in unison...Awwwwwwww!  :}', '2006-11-24 03:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058862, 428790, 56400, '<td valign="top">OK, so who WAS the best Wonka, Gene or Johnny?</td>', 'OK, so who WAS the best Wonka, Gene or Johnny?', '2006-11-24 03:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058863, 428466, 50034, '<td valign="top">You don''t leave anything to the imagination, do ya!  :}   <i>Franki Valli &amp; the Four Seasons</i> <b>"O, What a Night!"</b></td>', 'You don''t leave anything to the imagination, do ya!  :}   Franki Valli & the Four Seasons "O, What a Night!"', '2006-11-24 03:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058865, 428613, 50034, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait!  :)</td>', 'Nice portrait!  :)', '2006-11-24 03:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058866, 430143, 50034, '<td valign="top">"Twopence for your thoughts, Gouv''ner?"  :)  Great coinage!</td>', '"Twopence for your thoughts, Gouv''ner?"  :)  Great coinage!', '2006-11-24 03:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058867, 430020, 50034, '<td valign="top">A VERY good year!  :)</td>', 'A VERY good year!  :)', '2006-11-24 03:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058868, 428427, 50034, '<td valign="top">Great!  Looks just like a still captured from one of your dad''s old 8mm reels, Right?  :)</td>', 'Great!  Looks just like a still captured from one of your dad''s old 8mm reels, Right?  :)', '2006-11-24 03:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058870, 428514, 50034, '<td valign="top">Sweet!  You used Smart Blur for a photo about a fool...COOL!  :)</td>', 'Sweet!  You used Smart Blur for a photo about a fool...COOL!  :)', '2006-11-24 03:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058871, 430234, 56400, '<td valign="top">Needs about one more stop exposure.</td>', 'Needs about one more stop exposure.', '2006-11-24 03:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058898, 430330, 56400, '<td valign="top">What year are you claiming to be born in, 1892 when the original was written or 1954, when the words ''under God'' were added?<br/> <br/>reference: <a href="//history.vineyard.net/pledge.htm" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">The Pledge of Allegiance - A Short History</a></td>', 'What year are you claiming to be born in, 1892 when the original was written or 1954, when the words ''under God'' were added? reference: The Pledge of Allegiance - A Short History', '2006-11-24 03:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058906, 429615, 56400, '<td valign="top">Good shot but a little too dark.</td>', 'Good shot but a little too dark.', '2006-11-24 04:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058912, 429991, 56400, '<td valign="top">It looks a little grainy, but hey, nice legs in hose will beat that anytime.</td>', 'It looks a little grainy, but hey, nice legs in hose will beat that anytime.', '2006-11-24 04:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
