(3059697, 429159, 39429, '<td valign="top">"Your title should include the year."  I''ve got a good sense of the time period, but would love the year and a bit more to pin down the era.  Love the idea.<br/> <br/>Glad to see the year added.  Good luck.</td>', '"Your title should include the year."  I''ve got a good sense of the time period, but would love the year and a bit more to pin down the era.  Love the idea. Glad to see the year added.  Good luck.', '2006-11-24 12:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3059702, 428186, 39429, '<td valign="top">You''ve definately included a piece of the year ''76, and it is a fairly accurate rendition of the 2 dollar bill.  However, other than a reproduction, it gives me no sense of the time and place, making it very average.  5</td>', 'You''ve definately included a piece of the year ''76, and it is a fairly accurate rendition of the 2 dollar bill.  However, other than a reproduction, it gives me no sense of the time and place, making it very average.  5', '2006-11-24 12:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3059707, 430300, 39429, '<td valign="top">Wonderful expression, fun clothing and make-up.  The pose works for you.  Some things going against you include:  lighting - too close to the background, producing heavy shadows &amp; too close to the subject with the flash producing blown highlights and little detail.  The processing looks like you''ve added a diffused glow (which would be illegal in basic) or a large radius USM - which comes across to me as over done, even for the era. 5</td>', 'Wonderful expression, fun clothing and make-up.  The pose works for you.  Some things going against you include:  lighting - too close to the background, producing heavy shadows & too close to the subject with the flash producing blown highlights and little detail.  The processing looks like you''ve added a diffused glow (which would be illegal in basic) or a large radius USM - which comes across to me as over done, even for the era. 5', '2006-11-24 12:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3059712, 429688, 39429, '<td valign="top">Tough shot with the indoor lighting.  Interesting composition, but the lighting seems to have caused some problems in making this a top notch shot.  Much of the plane blends into the background reducing the impact.  5</td>', 'Tough shot with the indoor lighting.  Interesting composition, but the lighting seems to have caused some problems in making this a top notch shot.  Much of the plane blends into the background reducing the impact.  5', '2006-11-24 12:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3059715, 429730, 64987, '<td valign="top">there''s a lot going on but its placed pretty well and its a good crisp shot. 6</td>', 'there''s a lot going on but its placed pretty well and its a good crisp shot. 6', '2006-11-24 12:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3059716, 430380, 39429, '<td valign="top">The technicals on the image, DOF and focus, seem to be fine.  You''ve got a clean white bg and the border works with the image.  The interest factor and compostion didn''t work as well for you, making this image an average shot.  5</td>', 'The technicals on the image, DOF and focus, seem to be fine.  You''ve got a clean white bg and the border works with the image.  The interest factor and compostion didn''t work as well for you, making this image an average shot.  5', '2006-11-24 12:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3059719, 429481, 64987, '<td valign="top">I like it, wish there was a little more light, but over all nice shot</td>', 'I like it, wish there was a little more light, but over all nice shot', '2006-11-24 12:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3059723, 430478, 64987, '<td valign="top">Looks like a "myspace" shot. The smiley face should be a little higher. great idea though. :)</td>', 'Looks like a "myspace" shot. The smiley face should be a little higher. great idea though. :)', '2006-11-24 12:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3059725, 430467, 39429, '<td valign="top">Your idea is fine, but the execution seems strange.  The DOF works against you here, as does the strange gum composite.  My personal opinion is that the Wrigley Chewing Gum part of your title should not be needed, but be obvious by the image.  Right now I wouldn''t know what the shot is about without that part of the title.  5</td>', 'Your idea is fine, but the execution seems strange.  The DOF works against you here, as does the strange gum composite.  My personal opinion is that the Wrigley Chewing Gum part of your title should not be needed, but be obvious by the image.  Right now I wouldn''t know what the shot is about without that part of the title.  5', '2006-11-24 12:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3059728, 429431, 64987, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I wish it was a little sharper, detailed. I think maybe your ISO was a little high. or it''s out of focus</td>', 'Very nice, I wish it was a little sharper, detailed. I think maybe your ISO was a little high. or it''s out of focus', '2006-11-24 12:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3059730, 430017, 39429, '<td valign="top">I love the idea.  Footprints are hard to photograph correctly.  I''m guessing you were trying to replicate the actual photo and probably did a great job of it.  For a photo challenge, you run into a problem, since the original photo was not that successful as an image, just as a recording of history.  I think you would have to go beyond a reproduction in this challenge and create an even stronger image in order to be a top image.  IMHO.  5</td>', 'I love the idea.  Footprints are hard to photograph correctly.  I''m guessing you were trying to replicate the actual photo and probably did a great job of it.  For a photo challenge, you run into a problem, since the original photo was not that successful as an image, just as a recording of history.  I think you would have to go beyond a reproduction in this challenge and create an even stronger image in order to be a top image.  IMHO.  5', '2006-11-24 12:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3059735, 428198, 64987, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the onboard flash, looks like you turned on the "flower" setting. Background is distracting. But the Pig is AWESOME</td>', 'Don''t like the onboard flash, looks like you turned on the "flower" setting. Background is distracting. But the Pig is AWESOME', '2006-11-24 12:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3059736, 429885, 39429, '<td valign="top">Great old plate.  I like the sense of context with a lost and neglected plate.  Your colors also give me a feeling of age and neglect.  The lack of detail and a bit more contrast leaves me wanting more and keeps this image in the average group.  5</td>', 'Great old plate.  I like the sense of context with a lost and neglected plate.  Your colors also give me a feeling of age and neglect.  The lack of detail and a bit more contrast leaves me wanting more and keeps this image in the average group.  5', '2006-11-24 12:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3059737, 428181, 64987, '<td valign="top">dirty hands and a clean shot! nice.</td>', 'dirty hands and a clean shot! nice.', '2006-11-24 12:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3059739, 427844, 39429, '<td valign="top">Nice old newspaper.  The language gives me a sense of where you were born.  However, I''m not a fan of replicating an object without giving more context to why it''s important, making this an average shot for me.  5</td>', 'Nice old newspaper.  The language gives me a sense of where you were born.  However, I''m not a fan of replicating an object without giving more context to why it''s important, making this an average shot for me.  5', '2006-11-24 12:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3059740, 430253, 64987, '<td valign="top">way too out of focus. great concept tho</td>', 'way too out of focus. great concept tho', '2006-11-24 12:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3059742, 428752, 64987, '<td valign="top">not bad</td>', 'not bad', '2006-11-24 12:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3059743, 430013, 64987, '<td valign="top">Great shot! I think a smaller Aperture would have made this cleaner tho.</td>', 'Great shot! I think a smaller Aperture would have made this cleaner tho.', '2006-11-24 12:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3059744, 429986, 39429, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective, yet the composition is still a bit off.  I didn''t personally have any experience with the early video games, but I''ll take your word that blowin'' works.  I''d like to see more detail in the shadows and a bg better setting.  5</td>', 'Nice perspective, yet the composition is still a bit off.  I didn''t personally have any experience with the early video games, but I''ll take your word that blowin'' works.  I''d like to see more detail in the shadows and a bg better setting.  5', '2006-11-24 12:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3059745, 428514, 39429, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I''d love to see more of the jester cap and more contrast (and distance) between the subject and the bg.  It also feels like the skin has been over smoothed (or your subject has the clearest skin I''ve ever seen ;) .)  5</td>', 'Nice idea.  I''d love to see more of the jester cap and more contrast (and distance) between the subject and the bg.  It also feels like the skin has been over smoothed (or your subject has the clearest skin I''ve ever seen ;) .)  5', '2006-11-24 13:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3059748, 429978, 39429, '<td valign="top">Not having seen the album cover, this shot comes across as average.  It feels like the DOF is off a bit - in that middle land of being not sharp enough, or not dropping off enough.  5</td>', 'Not having seen the album cover, this shot comes across as average.  It feels like the DOF is off a bit - in that middle land of being not sharp enough, or not dropping off enough.  5', '2006-11-24 13:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
