(3060277, 430011, 55838, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  I was born on the day the world population became 4 billion but I couldn''t think of a way to portray that.  I love how you chose to do it.  Back to bump you up to 8 for creativity and a pleasant pic.</td>', 'Great idea.  I was born on the day the world population became 4 billion but I couldn''t think of a way to portray that.  I love how you chose to do it.  Back to bump you up to 8 for creativity and a pleasant pic.', '2006-11-24 19:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
