(3060283, 429830, 55838, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot.  I love the lighting and the effects in this pic.  Back to bump you up to 8.</td>', 'Very cool shot.  I love the lighting and the effects in this pic.  Back to bump you up to 8.', '2006-11-24 19:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
