(3060293, 429159, 55838, '<td valign="top">Too bad you didn''t have an old fashioned lamp.  They had such a nice clear glass.  This is a good idea and I like the perspective you chose.  Back to bump you up to 7.</td>', 'Too bad you didn''t have an old fashioned lamp.  They had such a nice clear glass.  This is a good idea and I like the perspective you chose.  Back to bump you up to 7.', '2006-11-24 19:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060431, 428186, 6519, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 3 for this, because in my opinion:<br/>1) yes, this note/bill may have been printed in the year you were born, but it certainly doesn''t DEFINE that year.<br/>2) simply taking a photo of a bill/note/stamp/picture is not showing much creativity <br/>3) the white balance is off, making the colors all wrong.</td>', 'I gave you a 3 for this, because in my opinion:1) yes, this note/bill may have been printed in the year you were born, but it certainly doesn''t DEFINE that year.2) simply taking a photo of a bill/note/stamp/picture is not showing much creativity 3) the white balance is off, making the colors all wrong.', '2006-11-24 21:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060463, 429972, 67710, '<td valign="top">I find the ribbon looks out of focus - at least on my monitor</td>', 'I find the ribbon looks out of focus - at least on my monitor', '2006-11-24 21:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060479, 429801, 164, '<td valign="top">blurry</td>', 'blurry', '2006-11-24 22:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060730, 429494, 39429, '<td valign="top">Fun stuff.  The expression, including the tongue and tape, is wonderful.  You''ve really gotten the details down.  Technically, I''d like to see a sharper focus throughout, and a less harsh lighting in the face.  Very nice.  6</td>', 'Fun stuff.  The expression, including the tongue and tape, is wonderful.  You''ve really gotten the details down.  Technically, I''d like to see a sharper focus throughout, and a less harsh lighting in the face.  Very nice.  6', '2006-11-25 00:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060735, 429946, 39429, '<td valign="top">Interesting recreation of an old image.  This looks so much like a shot from that era. I''d love to know how you got the UFO in there.  Unfortunately for this challenge, creating an image from this era produces an image that is lacking in detail and contrast.  I''d love to see you get both.  6</td>', 'Interesting recreation of an old image.  This looks so much like a shot from that era. I''d love to know how you got the UFO in there.  Unfortunately for this challenge, creating an image from this era produces an image that is lacking in detail and contrast.  I''d love to see you get both.  6', '2006-11-25 00:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060738, 430331, 39429, '<td valign="top">This brings back memories, but I swear I played it before ''72.  Must be my old lady memories. ;)  Technically very nice with good lighting and very nice colors.  The wow factor is just a bit short for a top pick, but I think you''ve pulled everything you can from this subject.  6</td>', 'This brings back memories, but I swear I played it before ''72.  Must be my old lady memories. ;)  Technically very nice with good lighting and very nice colors.  The wow factor is just a bit short for a top pick, but I think you''ve pulled everything you can from this subject.  6', '2006-11-25 00:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060740, 429543, 39429, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot and I like the idea for the year, but I don''t feel like the shot illustrates the year very well.  There is nothing here to bring me past the 40''s except the fisheye view.  This shot would do even better in the right challenge.  6</td>', 'I really like this shot and I like the idea for the year, but I don''t feel like the shot illustrates the year very well.  There is nothing here to bring me past the 40''s except the fisheye view.  This shot would do even better in the right challenge.  6', '2006-11-25 00:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060741, 430454, 39429, '<td valign="top">Very nice image that could be great with a few changes.  I''d love to see it just a bit sharper, and I''d love to see some motion blur on the star.  Well composed, well lit, and a great feel.  6</td>', 'Very nice image that could be great with a few changes.  I''d love to see it just a bit sharper, and I''d love to see some motion blur on the star.  Well composed, well lit, and a great feel.  6', '2006-11-25 00:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060744, 429071, 39429, '<td valign="top">A very nice photo, but not a wow.  I like the DOF, and would love to see part of the image tack sharp.  I''m actually enjoying the mic more than the CD.  It''s interesting and well lit.  6</td>', 'A very nice photo, but not a wow.  I like the DOF, and would love to see part of the image tack sharp.  I''m actually enjoying the mic more than the CD.  It''s interesting and well lit.  6', '2006-11-25 00:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060745, 429431, 39429, '<td valign="top">I''m intrigued with where you got ahold of the gold medals and how you were able to photograph them.  In a museum, perhaps?  Nice layout and composition.  The lighting is reasonable.  I''d love to see more of the story than this layout allows.  6</td>', 'I''m intrigued with where you got ahold of the gold medals and how you were able to photograph them.  In a museum, perhaps?  Nice layout and composition.  The lighting is reasonable.  I''d love to see more of the story than this layout allows.  6', '2006-11-25 00:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060748, 429730, 39429, '<td valign="top">I usually don''t like the composite item type images, but you''ve done an excellent job of assembling items together that share a story and bring back an era.  The title even adds to the image, providing the sinister feel.  The technicals kept this from being a top contender for me, as there are some bad reflections and a feeling that this should be sharper to accentuate the tools.  6</td>', 'I usually don''t like the composite item type images, but you''ve done an excellent job of assembling items together that share a story and bring back an era.  The title even adds to the image, providing the sinister feel.  The technicals kept this from being a top contender for me, as there are some bad reflections and a feeling that this should be sharper to accentuate the tools.  6', '2006-11-25 00:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060751, 429922, 39429, '<td valign="top">I was back and forth on this image between 5 &amp; 6, but finally gave a 6.  I like the shot and lighting, but the colors pulled me back.  They just feel wrong.  6</td>', 'I was back and forth on this image between 5 & 6, but finally gave a 6.  I like the shot and lighting, but the colors pulled me back.  They just feel wrong.  6', '2006-11-25 00:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060755, 430475, 39429, '<td valign="top">This shot intrigued me.  I remember the term, but can''t remember what it means.  The image casts a spell wanting me to capture the focus behind it and in it.  I love the color, DOF and the compositions.  Still, the questions I have keep me at a 6.</td>', 'This shot intrigued me.  I remember the term, but can''t remember what it means.  The image casts a spell wanting me to capture the focus behind it and in it.  I love the color, DOF and the compositions.  Still, the questions I have keep me at a 6.', '2006-11-25 00:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060758, 428201, 39429, '<td valign="top">I love the images you''ve captured on this wall.  I get the feeling this was not the real wall, but a representation of that wall.  Wonderful image that doesn''t quite capture the year for me.  6</td>', 'I love the images you''ve captured on this wall.  I get the feeling this was not the real wall, but a representation of that wall.  Wonderful image that doesn''t quite capture the year for me.  6', '2006-11-25 00:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060760, 430438, 39429, '<td valign="top">Nice use of DOF to capture the face and ribbon/breast in focus and leave the rest OOF.  Yes, it is ironic.  6</td>', 'Nice use of DOF to capture the face and ribbon/breast in focus and leave the rest OOF.  Yes, it is ironic.  6', '2006-11-25 00:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060764, 429525, 39429, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea and well shot photo.  I''m a bit bothered by the little boy in the image.  Is he crying because there are no more hangings?  that he is going to be hung?  or that someone has been hung (even though the rope is very clean)?  He just doesn''t fit right for me.  6</td>', 'Interesting idea and well shot photo.  I''m a bit bothered by the little boy in the image.  Is he crying because there are no more hangings?  that he is going to be hung?  or that someone has been hung (even though the rope is very clean)?  He just doesn''t fit right for me.  6', '2006-11-25 00:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060768, 430470, 39429, '<td valign="top">Your model looks like she is straight off of Haight &amp; Ashbury.  The yellow peace sign comes off a bit hokey and unreal (cut from paper and taped on?) but the rest of the image is extremely evocative of the period.  6</td>', 'Your model looks like she is straight off of Haight & Ashbury.  The yellow peace sign comes off a bit hokey and unreal (cut from paper and taped on?) but the rest of the image is extremely evocative of the period.  6', '2006-11-25 00:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060775, 428790, 39429, '<td valign="top">Chocolate - don''t we love it?  A well done shot that has some wonderful repetition.  The Cadbury brand takes away for me as it doesn''t quite work with the title. 6</td>', 'Chocolate - don''t we love it?  A well done shot that has some wonderful repetition.  The Cadbury brand takes away for me as it doesn''t quite work with the title. 6', '2006-11-25 00:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060792, 430428, 39429, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image and gorgeous lighting.  I''m lost a bit, because I don''t know the book.  Just took a moment to Search it.  Bumping to 7</td>', 'Beautiful image and gorgeous lighting.  I''m lost a bit, because I don''t know the book.  Just took a moment to Search it.  Bumping to 7', '2006-11-25 00:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060799, 430340, 39429, '<td valign="top">Very subtle, yet well done image.  I really like the reflections in the glasses.  This is an image that take awhile to really see.  At the initial view, the composition is strange and unsettling.  After seeing the reflection, it pops into understanding.  6</td>', 'Very subtle, yet well done image.  I really like the reflections in the glasses.  This is an image that take awhile to really see.  At the initial view, the composition is strange and unsettling.  After seeing the reflection, it pops into understanding.  6', '2006-11-25 01:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060813, 430330, 35530, '<td valign="top">Wow! You were born in 1892???</td>', 'Wow! You were born in 1892???', '2006-11-25 01:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060907, 430453, 39243, '<td valign="top">interesting photo. I wonder what people will think of this one. I think it is great. The small oppressed black girl looking up to the white girl is very appropriate for the time. The little black girl has a wonderful look of confidence and identiy. I think I am trying to say that the photo may represnt the feelings of the country at the time very well. Both sides - White superiority and Black defiance and integrity. I don''t want to say that whites were all like that but the idea comes across. Great photo the more I think on it. 8</td>', 'interesting photo. I wonder what people will think of this one. I think it is great. The small oppressed black girl looking up to the white girl is very appropriate for the time. The little black girl has a wonderful look of confidence and identiy. I think I am trying to say that the photo may represnt the feelings of the country at the time very well. Both sides - White superiority and Black defiance and integrity. I don''t want to say that whites were all like that but the idea comes across. Great photo the more I think on it. 8', '2006-11-25 03:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060910, 430300, 39243, '<td valign="top">the photo say it all - great 1985 retake!</td>', 'the photo say it all - great 1985 retake!', '2006-11-25 03:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060911, 429525, 39243, '<td valign="top">creepy! 7</td>', 'creepy! 7', '2006-11-25 03:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060912, 430302, 39243, '<td valign="top">7 great idea ! nice photo too</td>', '7 great idea ! nice photo too', '2006-11-25 03:17:19.000000', NULL, 1);
