(3061037, 430234, 35602, '<td valign="top">Love the dark mood of this image, and the shadows lead the eye to the figure.  Nice job.</td>', 'Love the dark mood of this image, and the shadows lead the eye to the figure.  Nice job.', '2006-11-25 06:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061041, 429071, 35602, '<td valign="top">great idea.  Never thought ofusing them for coasters.  Need better focus, though.  The cd isn''t really sharp.  Only the cover edge is and I think it doesn''t get across the idea because the focus seems to be strongest on the wrong thing.</td>', 'great idea.  Never thought ofusing them for coasters.  Need better focus, though.  The cd isn''t really sharp.  Only the cover edge is and I think it doesn''t get across the idea because the focus seems to be strongest on the wrong thing.', '2006-11-25 06:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061042, 430413, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very nice eclectic mix.  Well done and the shoes, socks and jeans continue the idea.  Great history lesson, too.</td>', 'Very nice eclectic mix.  Well done and the shoes, socks and jeans continue the idea.  Great history lesson, too.', '2006-11-25 06:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061044, 429885, 35602, '<td valign="top">Found the image too grainy for my tastes, though I guess the idea of age was why the technique was used.  Way out of focus, too.</td>', 'Found the image too grainy for my tastes, though I guess the idea of age was why the technique was used.  Way out of focus, too.', '2006-11-25 06:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061046, 428427, 35602, '<td valign="top">Need to keep track of your lines.  This one needed straightening.  Contrast and color seems too low, as well.</td>', 'Need to keep track of your lines.  This one needed straightening.  Contrast and color seems too low, as well.', '2006-11-25 06:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061048, 429309, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  If it isn''t a literal reprensentation, it is an awesome copy.  Love the treatment on this one.  Doesn''t often work but it does with this one.</td>', 'Very well done.  If it isn''t a literal reprensentation, it is an awesome copy.  Love the treatment on this one.  Doesn''t often work but it does with this one.', '2006-11-25 07:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061052, 428186, 35602, '<td valign="top">Not very interesting.</td>', 'Not very interesting.', '2006-11-25 07:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
