(3061561, 429991, 40370, '<td valign="top">Could be right out of a 1955 Sears Roebuck catalog. The added grain does an effective job of reminding me of older newspaper print. I love the stockings, the retro-looking foot stool, and the overall composition of this image, although, the model''s position looks a bit forced, as though you are looking UP just a bit too much.</td>', 'Could be right out of a 1955 Sears Roebuck catalog. The added grain does an effective job of reminding me of older newspaper print. I love the stockings, the retro-looking foot stool, and the overall composition of this image, although, the model''s position looks a bit forced, as though you are looking UP just a bit too much.', '2006-11-25 15:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061562, 430474, 40370, '<td valign="top">Yea 1964 !! I can''t wait to watch this classic again this season, nice job lighting the little characters and I like the "fluffy" stuff.</td>', 'Yea 1964 !! I can''t wait to watch this classic again this season, nice job lighting the little characters and I like the "fluffy" stuff.', '2006-11-25 15:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
