(3063707, 428201, 56658, '<td valign="top">You know i still find myself sometimes saying I was born in West Germany after all these years. it is amazing how much concrete affected the world. nice job.</td>', 'You know i still find myself sometimes saying I was born in West Germany after all these years. it is amazing how much concrete affected the world. nice job.', '2006-11-26 19:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3063708, 429543, 56658, '<td valign="top">love the fishy effect.</td>', 'love the fishy effect.', '2006-11-26 19:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3063718, 430302, 56658, '<td valign="top">sorry but as the title came up first i was excited to see a take on one of my all-time favs but i find your shot a bit disappointing for the title. to most people i would suspect they don''t even get the shot when compared to the movie. you could have used some foil and wire to stick out of the back of the car and made like it was attaching to the light post if you wanted to recreate the scene in docs garage but if you are alluding to the actual time machine then I am sorry but you have fallen short IMO.</td>', 'sorry but as the title came up first i was excited to see a take on one of my all-time favs but i find your shot a bit disappointing for the title. to most people i would suspect they don''t even get the shot when compared to the movie. you could have used some foil and wire to stick out of the back of the car and made like it was attaching to the light post if you wanted to recreate the scene in docs garage but if you are alluding to the actual time machine then I am sorry but you have fallen short IMO.', '2006-11-26 19:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3063723, 429969, 56658, '<td valign="top">was she trapped in a closet? other than the shirt i don''t get how the title is depicted in the photo.</td>', 'was she trapped in a closet? other than the shirt i don''t get how the title is depicted in the photo.', '2006-11-26 19:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
