(3064263, 429481, 57202, '<td valign="top">Very good use of lighting here and I love how the mic stand and the neck of the guitar form opposing diagonals. :)  Also, VERY nice touch shooting at a higher ISO to give it that older, grainy look!</td>', 'Very good use of lighting here and I love how the mic stand and the neck of the guitar form opposing diagonals. :)  Also, VERY nice touch shooting at a higher ISO to give it that older, grainy look!', '2006-11-26 23:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3064272, 429533, 57202, '<td valign="top">This is a very different concept from what I usually see on DPC...  And I like it! :)  You''ve taken a completely different approach to a photograph, managed to meet the challenge description, AND produced a wonderful image.  Well done!</td>', 'This is a very different concept from what I usually see on DPC...  And I like it! :)  You''ve taken a completely different approach to a photograph, managed to meet the challenge description, AND produced a wonderful image.  Well done!', '2006-11-26 23:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
