(3065702, 428427, 65744, '<td valign="top">i would make the building straight.  the coloring seems a bit dull.</td>', 'i would make the building straight.  the coloring seems a bit dull.', '2006-11-27 11:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065759, 430046, 48732, '<td valign="top">I must be missing something</td>', 'I must be missing something', '2006-11-27 12:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065790, 428427, 51185, '<td valign="top">this seems slightly over exposed... and im not quite seeing the 1954 bit.</td>', 'this seems slightly over exposed... and im not quite seeing the 1954 bit.', '2006-11-27 12:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065792, 429543, 51185, '<td valign="top">i like the way this is kind of concave looking</td>', 'i like the way this is kind of concave looking', '2006-11-27 12:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065793, 430039, 51185, '<td valign="top">awesome</td>', 'awesome', '2006-11-27 12:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065796, 429100, 51185, '<td valign="top">good movie!</td>', 'good movie!', '2006-11-27 12:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065881, 430463, 48732, '<td valign="top">LOL</td>', 'LOL', '2006-11-27 13:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065885, 429946, 48732, '<td valign="top">good idea less grainey than any of those 50''s shots...</td>', 'good idea less grainey than any of those 50''s shots...', '2006-11-27 13:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065924, 428427, 68256, '<td valign="top">Here are the reasons for my 1 vote:<br/>1.  I can''t interpret the photo to 1954...<br/>2.  unlevel horizon.<br/>3.  Blown highlights in sky and roof.<br/>4.  No subject.<br/>5.  Harsh lighting resulting in flat picture.</td>', 'Here are the reasons for my 1 vote:1.  I can''t interpret the photo to 1954...2.  unlevel horizon.3.  Blown highlights in sky and roof.4.  No subject.5.  Harsh lighting resulting in flat picture.', '2006-11-27 13:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065929, 429801, 68256, '<td valign="top">Nothing seems to be in focus and the arangment is too horizontal.  Why is a fruit loop covering Bart''s face?  There isn''t any separation from the background and subjects.</td>', 'Nothing seems to be in focus and the arangment is too horizontal.  Why is a fruit loop covering Bart''s face?  There isn''t any separation from the background and subjects.', '2006-11-27 13:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065933, 430085, 68256, '<td valign="top">It looks like the focus is in front of the tomato...I couldn''t tell it was a tomato without the subject.  The bright reflection and water? spots are distracting.  I don''t like the square composition either.  Sorry.</td>', 'It looks like the focus is in front of the tomato...I couldn''t tell it was a tomato without the subject.  The bright reflection and water? spots are distracting.  I don''t like the square composition either.  Sorry.', '2006-11-27 13:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065942, 430046, 68256, '<td valign="top">No year in title, too harsh lighting which causes bad reflections.  I think it would have been better to go with a larger f-stop (smaller number) to allow more natural light and blur the background.</td>', 'No year in title, too harsh lighting which causes bad reflections.  I think it would have been better to go with a larger f-stop (smaller number) to allow more natural light and blur the background.', '2006-11-27 13:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065948, 428514, 68256, '<td valign="top">I do not like the strange soft focus and waxy look of this photo.  It just looks too odd for me.</td>', 'I do not like the strange soft focus and waxy look of this photo.  It just looks too odd for me.', '2006-11-27 13:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065953, 430330, 24715, '<td valign="top">The photo looks washed out. Seems as contrast should be adjusted. No points deduced for missing year 1954...</td>', 'The photo looks washed out. Seems as contrast should be adjusted. No points deduced for missing year 1954...', '2006-11-27 13:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065955, 427682, 68256, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell what the object is in this photo but I do like the dof and b/w conversion.  The background is a bit distracting to me with all those lines going everywhere.  The lack of year in the title bumped it down 2 scores, mainly because I couldn''t date it at all.</td>', 'I can''t tell what the object is in this photo but I do like the dof and b/w conversion.  The background is a bit distracting to me with all those lines going everywhere.  The lack of year in the title bumped it down 2 scores, mainly because I couldn''t date it at all.', '2006-11-27 13:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065957, 430470, 68256, '<td valign="top">While it may have been intentional to be oof, because of the "acid", but it doesn''t work for me.  I don''t like the cropping (face cut in half) either.</td>', 'While it may have been intentional to be oof, because of the "acid", but it doesn''t work for me.  I don''t like the cropping (face cut in half) either.', '2006-11-27 13:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065961, 430046, 24715, '<td valign="top">Once again missing year. Hopefully your score doesn''t blow up ;-)</td>', 'Once again missing year. Hopefully your score doesn''t blow up ;-)', '2006-11-27 13:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065963, 429431, 68256, '<td valign="top">I like the composition but the harsh light killed it.  It looks so flat with all that direct flash light.  Increasing ISO, slowing down the shutter, and opening up the apeture (smaller f-number) (with a tripod) would have really made this a great shot I think.</td>', 'I like the composition but the harsh light killed it.  It looks so flat with all that direct flash light.  Increasing ISO, slowing down the shutter, and opening up the apeture (smaller f-number) (with a tripod) would have really made this a great shot I think.', '2006-11-27 13:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065965, 429922, 24715, '<td valign="top">Ha! Clever! Wished for a beetter background and neat sticker..</td>', 'Ha! Clever! Wished for a beetter background and neat sticker..', '2006-11-27 13:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065967, 430251, 68256, '<td valign="top">You were born when?</td>', 'You were born when?', '2006-11-27 13:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065981, 428703, 44490, '<td valign="top">Year of birth?  It''s hard to evaluate meeting the challenge.  Most viewers, including me, would like to see some sharp detail in most images, including this one.  Also consider cropping out the black borders, which seem to indicate a vidcap with digicam.</td>', 'Year of birth?  It''s hard to evaluate meeting the challenge.  Most viewers, including me, would like to see some sharp detail in most images, including this one.  Also consider cropping out the black borders, which seem to indicate a vidcap with digicam.', '2006-11-27 14:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065988, 430467, 24715, '<td valign="top">Could have been better if you actually had a red laser line going over the UPC code.</td>', 'Could have been better if you actually had a red laser line going over the UPC code.', '2006-11-27 14:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066031, 430427, 26001, '<td valign="top">very nice dof work here. a little warmth on the fingers (less bright) would have helped the shot a lot though.</td>', 'very nice dof work here. a little warmth on the fingers (less bright) would have helped the shot a lot though.', '2006-11-27 14:29:05.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3066065, 428607, 44490, '<td valign="top">Seems like it could be a powerful image and statement.  But the curve inversion just kills this image, leaving disconnected hair highlights.</td>', 'Seems like it could be a powerful image and statement.  But the curve inversion just kills this image, leaving disconnected hair highlights.', '2006-11-27 14:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066078, 429969, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice historical story.  Would be better if we could read the shirt, even better if he were holding and looking at a picture of her.</td>', 'Nice historical story.  Would be better if we could read the shirt, even better if he were holding and looking at a picture of her.', '2006-11-27 14:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066079, 428810, 44490, '<td valign="top">Could be a nice idea?  How about using a printed or computer screen backdrop of a marathon or NYC street scene?  I think that would have helped a lot.</td>', 'Could be a nice idea?  How about using a printed or computer screen backdrop of a marathon or NYC street scene?  I think that would have helped a lot.', '2006-11-27 14:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066080, 429801, 44490, '<td valign="top">Seems like you have good subjects to work with, but you''ve reduced them to obvious paper cutouts.  A 3D Homer doll plus carefully cut out Joe Montana arranged carefully could give a better for lighting and image/illusion of depth.</td>', 'Seems like you have good subjects to work with, but you''ve reduced them to obvious paper cutouts.  A 3D Homer doll plus carefully cut out Joe Montana arranged carefully could give a better for lighting and image/illusion of depth.', '2006-11-27 14:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066086, 430475, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Would be better with green cracker against a plain/white background, maybe with a (nibbling or dead) mouse, and more sharpness/DOF for more detail on the cracker.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Would be better with green cracker against a plain/white background, maybe with a (nibbling or dead) mouse, and more sharpness/DOF for more detail on the cracker.', '2006-11-27 14:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066108, 430470, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice elements, flower, peace sign, hand, curls, face, eye, nicely combined, interesting crop.  But the image is just too blurry everywhere.  Most viewers, including me, want to see at least some detail sharply in focus, otherwise it just becomes blurry and annoying, especially for something with nice elements, potential and promise.</td>', 'Nice elements, flower, peace sign, hand, curls, face, eye, nicely combined, interesting crop.  But the image is just too blurry everywhere.  Most viewers, including me, want to see at least some detail sharply in focus, otherwise it just becomes blurry and annoying, especially for something with nice elements, potential and promise.', '2006-11-27 14:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066112, 430413, 44490, '<td valign="top">All cool stuff, but simply overwhelming - too busy.  You have plenty of subjects from which to choose, choosing a few of them would be better than so many, with the challenge to arrange and display them so that they fit together.  By itself, the lower half minus the can would be better.</td>', 'All cool stuff, but simply overwhelming - too busy.  You have plenty of subjects from which to choose, choosing a few of them would be better than so many, with the challenge to arrange and display them so that they fit together.  By itself, the lower half minus the can would be better.', '2006-11-27 14:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066122, 429533, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea for a memorial.  While the artwork may be fine for close inspection in person, it is a bit busy for DPC and the 640-pixel limit.</td>', 'Nice idea for a memorial.  While the artwork may be fine for close inspection in person, it is a bit busy for DPC and the 640-pixel limit.', '2006-11-27 15:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066123, 429840, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice vintage batmobile.  Would be better with a little more angle so that the front grill doesn''t seem so in-your-face, with a touch more DOF so that Batman and Robin are more visible.</td>', 'Nice vintage batmobile.  Would be better with a little more angle so that the front grill doesn''t seem so in-your-face, with a touch more DOF so that Batman and Robin are more visible.', '2006-11-27 15:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066124, 430011, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and pretty good execution.  The image seems a bit too high-key for me, consider a fuller tonal range, and sharp focus/DOF for all 3 foreground paper people would help.  I like that you''ve created a feeling of many, and yet preserved subjects for main focus in the foreground.</td>', 'Nice idea and pretty good execution.  The image seems a bit too high-key for me, consider a fuller tonal range, and sharp focus/DOF for all 3 foreground paper people would help.  I like that you''ve created a feeling of many, and yet preserved subjects for main focus in the foreground.', '2006-11-27 15:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066126, 429543, 44490, '<td valign="top">Your image has a nice vintage feeling.  I like fisheye lenses, but it doesn''t really add much to this scene.  The scene feels older than 1961, how about a late 1950''s vintage car to give us a clue?  Also, a quick web search doesn''t seem to indicate anything special about 1961 and the telegraphs, can you point us to something specific?</td>', 'Your image has a nice vintage feeling.  I like fisheye lenses, but it doesn''t really add much to this scene.  The scene feels older than 1961, how about a late 1950''s vintage car to give us a clue?  Also, a quick web search doesn''t seem to indicate anything special about 1961 and the telegraphs, can you point us to something specific?', '2006-11-27 15:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066138, 429100, 44490, '<td valign="top">Powerful movie.  But how the table and fence fit together with the movie isn''t obvious to me - how about one or two fitting elements - a rifle, army helmet, rounds of ammunition, ammo can, etc.?</td>', 'Powerful movie.  But how the table and fence fit together with the movie isn''t obvious to me - how about one or two fitting elements - a rifle, army helmet, rounds of ammunition, ammo can, etc.?', '2006-11-27 15:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066172, 430358, 24715, '<td valign="top">Probably the best image of the challenge. Great detail.</td>', 'Probably the best image of the challenge. Great detail.', '2006-11-27 15:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066177, 430428, 24715, '<td valign="top">Nicely balanced, good color tone. Bump.</td>', 'Nicely balanced, good color tone. Bump.', '2006-11-27 15:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066213, 430046, 44490, '<td valign="top">From Wikipedia - Smiling Buddha was the first nuclear test explosion by India on May 18, 1974 at Pokhran.  Something more than the title would help, perhaps a backdrop of a mushroom cloud?  Also, it would be better than the busy background here.</td>', 'From Wikipedia - Smiling Buddha was the first nuclear test explosion by India on May 18, 1974 at Pokhran.  Something more than the title would help, perhaps a backdrop of a mushroom cloud?  Also, it would be better than the busy background here.', '2006-11-27 15:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066214, 430234, 44490, '<td valign="top">Striking idea and shadows.  But it''s just too difficult to make out any details.</td>', 'Striking idea and shadows.  But it''s just too difficult to make out any details.', '2006-11-27 15:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066216, 429904, 44490, '<td valign="top">Vintage looking car, fitting for the challenge.  Wish you would have pulled it out for better lighting and a better setting, as it is, the car looses a bit to the brightly lit house and fence.</td>', 'Vintage looking car, fitting for the challenge.  Wish you would have pulled it out for better lighting and a better setting, as it is, the car looses a bit to the brightly lit house and fence.', '2006-11-27 15:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066217, 430477, 44490, '<td valign="top">The title seems fitting, but we need a little help - what happened in Germany in 1975?  A quick google search didn''t show an obvious match - not tours by Bill Monroe nor Thin Lizzy.  Help?</td>', 'The title seems fitting, but we need a little help - what happened in Germany in 1975?  A quick google search didn''t show an obvious match - not tours by Bill Monroe nor Thin Lizzy.  Help?', '2006-11-27 15:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066222, 430292, 44490, '<td valign="top">Good idea, pretty good execution.  How about a slightly looser pose that''s clearly dancing, and more eyes are almost always better.</td>', 'Good idea, pretty good execution.  How about a slightly looser pose that''s clearly dancing, and more eyes are almost always better.', '2006-11-27 15:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066224, 430386, 44490, '<td valign="top">Good idea and pretty good execution, interesting lighting.  I also had a problem with wrinkles/creases on my backdrop, and wished for a bigger room for DOF separation, or advanced editing.</td>', 'Good idea and pretty good execution, interesting lighting.  I also had a problem with wrinkles/creases on my backdrop, and wished for a bigger room for DOF separation, or advanced editing.', '2006-11-27 15:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066225, 429730, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and pretty good execution.  Slightly simpler would be better, eliminate one of the locks and a few of the tools.</td>', 'Nice idea and pretty good execution.  Slightly simpler would be better, eliminate one of the locks and a few of the tools.', '2006-11-27 15:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066226, 430287, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and interesting composition with crop below eyes.  I think that cropping out some of the negative space would be better.</td>', 'Nice idea and interesting composition with crop below eyes.  I think that cropping out some of the negative space would be better.', '2006-11-27 15:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066229, 429688, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice clear shot of the U2, we can guess that the lighting was very difficult, and the choices of perspective limited.  Probably tough for DPC, but I appreciate the effort, especially as a fellow aviation buff, and it''s nicely done under the circumstances.</td>', 'Nice clear shot of the U2, we can guess that the lighting was very difficult, and the choices of perspective limited.  Probably tough for DPC, but I appreciate the effort, especially as a fellow aviation buff, and it''s nicely done under the circumstances.', '2006-11-27 15:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066230, 430252, 44490, '<td valign="top">Lovely radio with a lot of nostalgia.  A less distracting background and non-striped shirt would probably be better, allowing the user to focus on the really nice radio, clarity, wood.</td>', 'Lovely radio with a lot of nostalgia.  A less distracting background and non-striped shirt would probably be better, allowing the user to focus on the really nice radio, clarity, wood.', '2006-11-27 15:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066231, 430473, 44490, '<td valign="top">Great idea and pretty good execution.  Unfortunately, I think that the noise/grain effect is so overdone that it detracts from an otherwise very powerful and well done image.</td>', 'Great idea and pretty good execution.  Unfortunately, I think that the noise/grain effect is so overdone that it detracts from an otherwise very powerful and well done image.', '2006-11-27 15:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066235, 430013, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity and interesting arrangement and lighting.  I think that most people will miss GARP == Geographical Atlas using Radial Projections.  Something more is needed to tie into John Irving''s novel.</td>', 'Nice clarity and interesting arrangement and lighting.  I think that most people will miss GARP == Geographical Atlas using Radial Projections.  Something more is needed to tie into John Irving''s novel.', '2006-11-27 15:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066236, 430340, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I missed it on the first viewing, but caught it on the second viewing.  Maybe it would help to put a gradient on the background flag image, so that the reflection in the sunglasses is more even, with more light to the field of stars.</td>', 'Nice idea.  I missed it on the first viewing, but caught it on the second viewing.  Maybe it would help to put a gradient on the background flag image, so that the reflection in the sunglasses is more even, with more light to the field of stars.', '2006-11-27 15:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066243, 429681, 44490, '<td valign="top">Aha, you can''t fool me, she''s too good looking for Sid Vicious.  More seriously, the image is gritty, dark, powerful, and oddly effective, even the tilt and the curtains in the background.</td>', 'Aha, you can''t fool me, she''s too good looking for Sid Vicious.  More seriously, the image is gritty, dark, powerful, and oddly effective, even the tilt and the curtains in the background.', '2006-11-27 15:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066244, 427682, 66127, '<td valign="top">what year is this? perhaps a mixed up perspective aplicant?</td>', 'what year is this? perhaps a mixed up perspective aplicant?', '2006-11-27 15:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066246, 430428, 44490, '<td valign="top">Didn''t you mean "Thunderball?"  Error, error, ... ;=)  But more mercifully, your image is a lovely study, the sharp squares of the mirrorball versus the smooth skin, etc.  Maybe adding a Walther PPK or similar looking handgun would give a stronger tie to Thunderball and James Bond.</td>', 'Didn''t you mean "Thunderball?"  Error, error, ... ;=)  But more mercifully, your image is a lovely study, the sharp squares of the mirrorball versus the smooth skin, etc.  Maybe adding a Walther PPK or similar looking handgun would give a stronger tie to Thunderball and James Bond.', '2006-11-27 15:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066251, 429481, 44490, '<td valign="top">Good idea and tribute.  I think that the mic stand is a minus - too in-your-face and distracting.  With the shades, a little more lighting on the face would probably be better, without loosing the illusion.</td>', 'Good idea and tribute.  I think that the mic stand is a minus - too in-your-face and distracting.  With the shades, a little more lighting on the face would probably be better, without loosing the illusion.', '2006-11-27 15:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066252, 429615, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and title, matching sky.  Exposure balance might be better with a little more for the foreground, giving needed detail to the gun emplacement while preserving most of the sky.</td>', 'Nice idea and title, matching sky.  Exposure balance might be better with a little more for the foreground, giving needed detail to the gun emplacement while preserving most of the sky.', '2006-11-27 15:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066257, 430017, 24715, '<td valign="top">Good reproduction. Lighting is excellent, definitely gives the lunar feel.</td>', 'Good reproduction. Lighting is excellent, definitely gives the lunar feel.', '2006-11-27 15:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066258, 428790, 44490, '<td valign="top">Chocolate is wonderful, and your image has a wonderful range of lighting reflection effects on the chocolate that is just delightful.  Wish for an additional element to tie into 1971, but it may be good enough to stand alone.</td>', 'Chocolate is wonderful, and your image has a wonderful range of lighting reflection effects on the chocolate that is just delightful.  Wish for an additional element to tie into 1971, but it may be good enough to stand alone.', '2006-11-27 15:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066263, 430274, 66127, '<td valign="top">great angles and representation!</td>', 'great angles and representation!', '2006-11-27 15:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066270, 430013, 24715, '<td valign="top">Good detail and composition. However, DOF could be a little deeper to get pencil hand in a sharper focus.</td>', 'Good detail and composition. However, DOF could be a little deeper to get pencil hand in a sharper focus.', '2006-11-27 15:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066274, 429102, 66127, '<td valign="top">specific year?</td>', 'specific year?', '2006-11-27 15:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066277, 428752, 44490, '<td valign="top">Great tribute image, complete with wreath and vintage cars.  Car seems a bit too dominant, consider cropping more, maybe cropping out the plate.</td>', 'Great tribute image, complete with wreath and vintage cars.  Car seems a bit too dominant, consider cropping more, maybe cropping out the plate.', '2006-11-27 15:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066280, 430453, 44490, '<td valign="top">Good idea, composition, interesting expressions.  Seems like a touch of back focus, but I like it a lot.</td>', 'Good idea, composition, interesting expressions.  Seems like a touch of back focus, but I like it a lot.', '2006-11-27 15:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066282, 429991, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, pose, expression.  Would be better without the curtain, maybe slightly more relaxed hand.  Effective.</td>', 'Nice idea, pose, expression.  Would be better without the curtain, maybe slightly more relaxed hand.  Effective.', '2006-11-27 15:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066283, 430454, 44490, '<td valign="top">All of the elements seem to hang together very nicely - nice hands, nails, sleeves, rings, star - very nice.</td>', 'All of the elements seem to hang together very nicely - nice hands, nails, sleeves, rings, star - very nice.', '2006-11-27 15:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066284, 429102, 44490, '<td valign="top">1969?  Nice idea, image, expression, headband, hair color.  Simple and effective, just missing confirmation of the year.</td>', '1969?  Nice idea, image, expression, headband, hair color.  Simple and effective, just missing confirmation of the year.', '2006-11-27 15:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066285, 430427, 44490, '<td valign="top">Great idea and execution, nicely done tribute, effective.</td>', 'Great idea and execution, nicely done tribute, effective.', '2006-11-27 15:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066286, 430251, 66127, '<td valign="top">what year?</td>', 'what year?', '2006-11-27 15:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066288, 430287, 66127, '<td valign="top">nice. you dont see as many red ribbons anymore now that the war and breat cancer are big issues.</td>', 'nice. you dont see as many red ribbons anymore now that the war and breat cancer are big issues.', '2006-11-27 15:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066290, 430454, 24715, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and detail.</td>', 'Excellent lighting and detail.', '2006-11-27 15:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066294, 430482, 66127, '<td valign="top">i would have liked a bit larger dof.</td>', 'i would have liked a bit larger dof.', '2006-11-27 15:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066299, 429681, 66127, '<td valign="top">i love the sex pistols. great representation!</td>', 'i love the sex pistols. great representation!', '2006-11-27 15:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066308, 428181, 66127, '<td valign="top">nice. the dirty nails are a nice touch.</td>', 'nice. the dirty nails are a nice touch.', '2006-11-27 16:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066317, 429972, 66127, '<td valign="top">its hard to come by an aids ribbon these days. its good to see someone remembers.</td>', 'its hard to come by an aids ribbon these days. its good to see someone remembers.', '2006-11-27 16:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066321, 430442, 66127, '<td valign="top">maybe next time use a less distracting background.</td>', 'maybe next time use a less distracting background.', '2006-11-27 16:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066325, 429309, 66127, '<td valign="top">jimi!</td>', 'jimi!', '2006-11-27 16:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066326, 430046, 66127, '<td valign="top">the reflections in his race and belly are kind of distracting.</td>', 'the reflections in his race and belly are kind of distracting.', '2006-11-27 16:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
