(3069875, 428607, 54778, '<td valign="top">Very interesting challenge to enter and just as un-dpc friendly the pic.. <br/> <br/>I liked the composition and the way everything made an impact.. good or bad it was up to the viewer of course.. I really did expect it to go down like a dying duck..<br/> <br/>The nails ahem.. I have very nice nails.. dunno why they look like crap in the pic.. (the lady who commented on how nice they looked in the supermarket jinxed them arghh.. long story..) I only noticed them after I uploaded the pic here...<br/> <br/>Oh and wow to the people who noticed what the bottle was for.. I didn''t even read the label when I picked it up.. <br/> <br/><b>What I did to pic ..</b> <br/> <br/>Gradient map <br/>Copper<br/>inverse copper<br/>fade with luminosity<br/> <br/></td>', 'Very interesting challenge to enter and just as un-dpc friendly the pic..  I liked the composition and the way everything made an impact.. good or bad it was up to the viewer of course.. I really did expect it to go down like a dying duck.. The nails ahem.. I have very nice nails.. dunno why they look like crap in the pic.. (the lady who commented on how nice they looked in the supermarket jinxed them arghh.. long story..) I only noticed them after I uploaded the pic here... Oh and wow to the people who noticed what the bottle was for.. I didn''t even read the label when I picked it up..  What I did to pic ..  Gradient map Copperinverse copperfade with luminosity ', '2006-11-29 00:15:40.000000', NULL, 0),
