(3070611, 429494, 49109, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, congrats to your next well deserved ribbon!</td>', 'Excellent shot, congrats to your next well deserved ribbon!', '2006-11-29 02:55:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(3070631, 430463, 30982, '<td valign="top">This so totally rocks.  I LOVE this shot.  Loved it in the challenge, and love it even more knowing it''s yours.  I grew up with Monty Python''s Flying Circus (my whole family is kinda warped) so this really resonates with me.  Add to that the sheer slightly insane joy it portrays and it''s a marvelous shot.  By the way, the stuff behind the head?  Kinda fits with the whole Python thing, really.  And I''m quite in awe of such a clear shot of a human at 1/8th sec.  Sorry if you hate seeing it on your top row, but there are a whole lot of us who quite like it!  Check out the comments!</td>', 'This so totally rocks.  I LOVE this shot.  Loved it in the challenge, and love it even more knowing it''s yours.  I grew up with Monty Python''s Flying Circus (my whole family is kinda warped) so this really resonates with me.  Add to that the sheer slightly insane joy it portrays and it''s a marvelous shot.  By the way, the stuff behind the head?  Kinda fits with the whole Python thing, really.  And I''m quite in awe of such a clear shot of a human at 1/8th sec.  Sorry if you hate seeing it on your top row, but there are a whole lot of us who quite like it!  Check out the comments!', '2006-11-29 03:13:42.000000', NULL, 0),
