(3070761, 430428, 55838, '<td valign="top">This is beautifully done.  I''m not a big nude fan but I think nudity works on DPC if it''s not "in-your-face-look-at-my-boobies" kind of nudity but rather a true piece of artwork.  This definitely falls into the artwork category.  Way to go!</td>', 'This is beautifully done.  I''m not a big nude fan but I think nudity works on DPC if it''s not "in-your-face-look-at-my-boobies" kind of nudity but rather a true piece of artwork.  This definitely falls into the artwork category.  Way to go!', '2006-11-29 05:04:06.000000', NULL, 0),
