(3071922, 430427, 14620, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the wonderful comments everyone!!  Though I was just a baby during this year, this is one of those songs that''ll be around forever and was a staple in my childhood. :-)  I tend to lean towards music as inspriration and while googling I came across this album and was pretty stoked that the timing was good.  I just had to try it.  Wish I could''ve done a little better job, but I still like it.  I''m glad so many people "got it". :)</td>', 'Thanks for all the wonderful comments everyone!!  Though I was just a baby during this year, this is one of those songs that''ll be around forever and was a staple in my childhood. :-)  I tend to lean towards music as inspriration and while googling I came across this album and was pretty stoked that the timing was good.  I just had to try it.  Wish I could''ve done a little better job, but I still like it.  I''m glad so many people "got it". :)', '2006-11-29 12:30:12.000000', NULL, 0),
