(3072271, 430284, 51538, '<td valign="top">The <a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/EDSA_Revolution" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">People Power Revolution</a> of 1986 in the Philippines.  As said, a very powerful image.  Timely in many ways.</td>', 'The People Power Revolution of 1986 in the Philippines.  As said, a very powerful image.  Timely in many ways.', '2006-11-29 14:10:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3072514, 430143, 30982, '<td valign="top">First off I think it''s incredibly cool that you have such a nice collection of coins from the year of your birth.  Wish I''d done the same!  Some of your commenters have made good points - it looks like a documentary shot which is fine for that purpose but may be lacking for the purposes of "DPC wow!" and score.  Detail is pretty good for having such varying surfaces/colors to work with; lighting is even.  Definitely a very cool collection!</td>', 'First off I think it''s incredibly cool that you have such a nice collection of coins from the year of your birth.  Wish I''d done the same!  Some of your commenters have made good points - it looks like a documentary shot which is fine for that purpose but may be lacking for the purposes of "DPC wow!" and score.  Detail is pretty good for having such varying surfaces/colors to work with; lighting is even.  Definitely a very cool collection!', '2006-11-29 15:18:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3072548, 430253, 30982, '<td valign="top">A couple of interesting things this picture tells me - the most significant of which is that I didn''t know it took nearly a year for the commission to submit their final report.  In my dealings with the government, that''s actually not bad!  I with the "I like the pencil" gang on this one - adds a dimension that would be lacking without it.</td>', 'A couple of interesting things this picture tells me - the most significant of which is that I didn''t know it took nearly a year for the commission to submit their final report.  In my dealings with the government, that''s actually not bad!  I with the "I like the pencil" gang on this one - adds a dimension that would be lacking without it.', '2006-11-29 15:26:24.000000', NULL, 0),
